Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.30,H_en,,0,0,0,,After dying once, I have no bottom line anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:40.30,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.98,S_en,,0,0,0,,Stealing my bestie's suitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.02,0:00:04.98,S_en,,0,0,0,,Sounds like zero integrity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.02,0:00:08.21,S_en,,0,0,0,,But after dying once,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.25,0:00:12.24,S_en,,0,0,0,,integrity is the cheapest thing I own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:14.24,S_en,,0,0,0,,Song Jingyi has no shortage of suitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:16.24,S_en,,0,0,0,,Handsome ones, fit ones, rich ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:18.24,S_en,,0,0,0,,Even ones who help her with school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.24,S_en,,0,0,0,,What makes you think you can win her?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.24,S_en,,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,Even if Jingyi doesn't pick me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:24.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,it'll never be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.31,0:00:25.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,I thought you were just ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.31,0:00:27.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,Turns out you're shameless too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:28.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,Me? Shameless?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.31,0:00:29.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,We're both in the sports department.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.31,0:00:30.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,You knew I'm Jingyi's best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,You pretended to care about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:32.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,dropped flirty hints,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.31,0:00:34.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,all to get close to Jingyi through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.31,0:00:35.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,So who used whom first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.31,0:00:36.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,This Mi Ke looks dumb,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.31,0:00:38.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,yet she saw right through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.31,0:00:39.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:40.27,S_en,,0,0,0,,Jiang Muyi.
